msgid "A list of translated strings."
msgstr ""
"**翻訳された文字列のリスト**\n"
"\n"
"*   `Hello` → `こんにちは`\n"
"*   `World` → `世界`\n"
"*   ` Foo Bar` → `フー バル`\n"
"*   `` → ``\n"
"\n"
"**特定のラベル** \n"
"\n"
"### リスト\n"
"\n"
"| 文字列 | 語訳 |\n"
"|:--------|:-------|\n"
"| Hello    | Konnichiwa |\n"
"| World    | Sekai   |\n"
"| Foo Bar  | Fū Bāru |\n"
"\n"
"**特殊なラベル**\n"
"\n"
"*   `` → ``\n"
"*   `` → ``\n"
"*   `` → ``"

